{"policyVersion":3,"items":[{"translations":{"en":["Yondemasu yo, Azazel-san.","The great detective Akutabe has an assistant, Rinko Sakuma, who is trying to learn to summon demons. This is the story of her misadventure when she actually manages to summon 2 demons unexpectedly.\n\n\n\n(Source: Anime News Network)"],"ja":["よんでますよ、アザゼルさん。",""]},"airedAt":null,"relations":[],"id":"mal-7762","ids":{"shikimori":7762,"mal":7762,"anilist":7762,"kodik":"serial-35570"},"kodikIds":["serial-8217","serial-22056","serial-35570"],"kodikRevisions":{"serial-8217":"2020-01-10T15:57:14Z","serial-22056":"2020-01-31T00:36:45Z","serial-35570":"2021-07-02T22:41:10Z"},"title":"Явись, Азазель! OVA","originalTitle":"Yondemasu yo, Azazel-san.","alt":"You're Being Summoned, Azazel-san. よんでますよ、アザゼルさん。","description":"Ринко Сакума — ассистентка у величайшего детектива Акутабэ . Вот только детектив непростой — свои проблемы он решает вызовом демонов. Девушка, поддерживая планку, старается тоже выучиться призыву демонических существ. Эта история о её неудачной попытке, когда пред ней предстаёт совсем не то, что она хотела увидеть.","year":2010,"type":"OVA","genres":["сэйнэн","Комедия","Сверхъестественное","гэг юмор","мифология"],"rating":7.57,"popularity":7599,"ongoing":false,"relatedMalIds":[],"artwork":{"poster":{"url":"https://shikimori.io/uploads/poster/animes/7762/ce5538b6abada8388a672585b0e9f952.jpeg","width":225,"height":320},"backdrop":{"url":"https://shikimori.io/system/screenshots/original/de556e640cb318010230cd7184a0e5dc357348c5.jpg","width":960,"height":540}},"releasedEpisodes":[1,2,3,4],"episodes":[{"number":1,"ordinal":1,"season":1,"audio":[{"id":"kodik-609","dubId":"609","label":"AniDUB","language":"ru","original":false,"duration":null,"sources":[],"subtitles":[],"opening":null,"ending":null,"validation":"provider-link","providerRef":{"provider":"kodik","releaseId":"serial-8217","translationId":"609","url":"https://kodikplayer.com/seria/212732/945be06024fe9f1b69c8d60f140ac6c8/720p",